# Three Paths (mission.cop.three_paths#yoran). A level 75 Warrior with 5-3 current (a GM) in Windurst Walls; login plays
# Rhapsodies of Vana'diel's zone-in 30035, finished. A GM sets Louverance 6 and Ulmia 6, so both sections answer at
# Yoran-Oran. Trigger one: 481 (Louverance's); trigger two: 473 (Ulmia's progress event), finished: Ulmia 7; trigger
# three: 479 (Ulmia's). The order is the trace's own.
lists WindurstWalls/Yoran-Oran/onTrigger WindurstWalls/onEventFinish/473
char zone=WindurstWalls pos=-110,-14,203.3 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=2
